source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: `:` is not escapable; the backslash stays visible, so an emoticon starting with `:` cannot be defused this way.
-- input.jira --
a\:b
-- rendered.html --
<p>a\:b</p>
-- want.md --
a\\:b
-- warnings.json --
[]
